"If you use a card, check that it is inserted and that the reader is "
"connected."

msgid "panel.certificate.failed.title"
msgstr "We could not look for certificates"

msgid "panel.certificate.failed.body"
msgstr ""
"The search failed before finishing, so we do not know whether there is any."

#. {{date}} es la fecha de caducidad, ya formateada según el idioma.
msgid "panel.certificate.expired"
msgstr "The certificate expired on {{date}}, so it cannot be used to sign."

msgid "panel.certificate.notYetValid"
msgstr "The certificate is not valid yet, so it cannot be used to sign."

#. {{reason}} es el motivo de la revocación, tal como lo da el certificado.
msgid "panel.certificate.revoked"
msgstr "The certificate is revoked ({{reason}}), so it cannot be used to sign."

msgid "panel.certificate.unreadable"
msgstr "This certificate could not be read, so it cannot be used to sign."

