#. El titular del diálogo de páginas sin sello: {{count}} páginas donde el recuadro no cabe.
msgid "sealLoss.title"
msgid_plural "sealLoss.title"
msgstr[0] "One page will be left without a seal"
msgstr[1] "{{count}} pages will be left without a seal"
msgstr[2] "{{count}} pages will be left without a seal"

#. {{fallen}} páginas de {{chosen}} elegidas no caben el recuadro, más pequeñas que aquella sobre la que se colocó.
msgid "sealLoss.body"
msgstr ""
"The box does not fit on {{fallen}} of the {{chosen}} pages you chose, "
"smaller than the one you placed it on. The document will be signed all the "
"same and the signature will be valid throughout it, but the seal will not "
"appear on those pages."

#. La vuelta positiva: {{sealed}} de {{chosen}} páginas elegidas sí llevarán el sello.
msgid "sealLoss.remaining"
msgstr "The seal will appear on {{sealed}} of the {{chosen}} chosen pages."

msgid "sealLoss.confirm"
msgstr "Sign anyway"

