msgstr "Version {{version}}"

msgid "about.whatItDoes"
msgstr ""
"Signs and countersigns PDF documents with your certificate. Neither the "
"document nor the private key leaves your computer."

msgid "about.independence"
msgstr ""
"Independent project. rFirma is not related to AutoFirma or to the Spanish "
"Administration, who publish the official client, nor is it endorsed by them. "
"If you need the official application, download it from their website."

